## Keyboard interactions

- Closed trigger: <Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> select directly; <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> opens and moves focus in; type to jump.
- Open list: arrows move highlight, <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> commits and closes, <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes and refocuses, <Kbd>Tab</Kbd> dismisses.
- Combobox triggers need an author-provided name (`aria-label`) — see the demo.
